#: prefs.py:22
msgid "A lack of weights will always be indicated with black color to differentiate it from a weight of 0.0 being assigned"
msgstr "缺少权重时始终以黑色表示，以区别于已指定权重 0.0"

#: prefs.py:109
msgid "Accumulate"
