msgid "All weight paint brushes share the same Strength value, instead of each brush having its own"
msgstr "所有权重绘制笔刷共用同一个强度值，而非每个笔刷各自拥有"

#: prefs.py:114
msgid "All weight paint brushes switch between a 3D spherical or a 2D projected circular falloff shape"
msgstr "所有权重绘制笔刷在 3D 球形或 2D 投影圆形衰减形状之间切换"

